# Document Browser

Module194283Name = Document Browser
Module194283Desc = Attach files stored in Dolibarr (records, products, Documents, medias) to emails, as attachments or share links
Permission19428301 = Attach files stored in Dolibarr to emails

DocBrowserSetup = Document Browser setup
DocBrowserSetupPage = Picked files are copied when they are added to an email, so the originals are never changed or deleted.
DocBrowserMaxAttach = Maximum total size of attachments (MB)
DocBrowserMaxAttachDesc = When the attachments of an email together go over this size, the largest files picked from Dolibarr are sent as share links instead. Files uploaded from the computer are always attached. 0 = always attach.
DocBrowserResize = Resize attached images (longest side, pixels)
DocBrowserResizeDesc = JPEG, PNG, GIF and WebP images larger than this are sent as a smaller copy. Share links always give the original. 0 = send originals.
DocBrowserExpire = Remove share links after (days)
DocBrowserExpireDesc = Share links this module created stop working this many days after the last email that included them. Links you share by hand are never removed. Needs the Scheduled jobs module. 0 = keep.
DocBrowserLinksTitleSetting = Heading above share links
DocBrowserLinksTitleSettingDesc = Shown above the list of links in the email. Empty = "%s".
DocBrowserWhere = Where it appears
DocBrowserWhereDesc = "Add from Dolibarr…" next to the Attach button of the Send by email form of every card, and in modules that use it (Convomail compose).
DocBrowserCronExpireShares = Remove expired Document Browser share links
DocBrowserCronExpireSharesHelp = Removes share links created by Document Browser that were last sent longer ago than set up

